  "protocol": "One independent evaluation of 80 statements on 20 trial-disjoint registry studies with the same construction rules and two templates. Fix the observed sample, labels, original select rule, Direct prompts and score code before any inference. Run Direct and Select once per item per pinned model. Primary endpoint is each model separately: difference in correct judgments of Select with Direct fallback versus Direct, with new errors, corrections and paired trial percentile intervals using the fixed earlier scorer. The explicit-ambiguity-priority alternative is prespecified and secondary. All results remain in the denominator. No tuning, no rerun for content or truncation, no outcome-driven exclusions.",
